{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）中午12時40分，將軍澳駿才街無綫電視電視廣播城內的片場發生火警。消防接報派出4條喉及3隊煙帽隊到場撲救，24分鐘後將火救熄，無人受傷，救護車在場戒備。</p><figure><img alt=\"片場內的搭建物陷入火海。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142093604735422464847390.jpeg/PNu4D-5n2YNY5bQk1EnKMnbxomOuBD0OR4repEeK3qQ\"/><figcaption>片場內的搭建物陷入火海。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>從讀者提供影片可見，民初街一棟2層樓高的搭建物陷入火海，地下至2樓均告起火，窗戶噴出烈焰和濃煙。火勢大致救熄後，消防員持續射水，可見搭建物側面燒剩支架。</p><figure><img alt=\"民初街片場一棟2層樓高的搭建物陷火海，由地下至2樓均有起火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142092926722248704681572.png/OxPMY6FzodeLk68MYCUAyYdlGJZd1BeRj4skDo-LJA4\"/><figcaption>民初街片場一棟2層樓高的搭建物陷火海，由地下至2樓均有起火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"搭建物火光熊熊。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142092924402667520962071.png/d_WcXUC5QJjx0Hut-v_E7N9oVHUCqpYwz43o5s-N6OY\"/><figcaption>搭建物火光熊熊。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142095292636860416176928.jpeg/A5_8sgGb9oaUEt1WbXjBTgNnChtojW-dX5v2_V-b9v0\"/><figcaption>消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可見搭建物側面燒剩支架。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142095289822351360134802.jpeg/k9UfJQ-DmQHXxOt_nVffPYHB1CEUfEsbTq7vfk6u734\"/><figcaption>可見搭建物側面燒剩支架。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142095286898790400927013.jpeg/tYtib4mdCR1PZUc34BH7Ij1-z1FI7Ipcoud0p6LndKc\"/><figcaption>消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為TVB電視城片場。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142095699706384384684901.jpeg/YOn_YfI2698JnvRaydj8Q2oEAXkreSidJ_1gDif9YA4\"/><figcaption>現場為TVB電視城片場。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142099317339721728947086.jpeg/hEoAM6kMeXxvOXpraxzZp4L3eOJYalyKM3syeRl7Mnk\"/><figcaption>消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"搭建物頂部瞥燒至熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142099406045057024683597.jpeg/ckB0KzSnoXGnKL61iBa9HsqUp4CsWPWFxMHRje7B0Y0\"/><figcaption>搭建物頂部瞥燒至熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142099055766147072892041.jpeg/ZO6SVL7ymwBJQxBgh7Geze6GDn1bB8-pDft54Cf7eeA\"/><figcaption>消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142099058467409920068342.jpeg/fIjk4MGM5bMZjrb2eab1oXnKTUuaMaNl3oLAg_SCwIM\"/><figcaption>消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142099061294501888520374.jpeg/9SPz3K486TLMEeWBuda84fPRe9M78v85oXbR64t20es\"/><figcaption>消防員向搭建物射水灌救。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TVB電視城片場搭建物陷火海。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142099066512478208470932.jpeg/wK9NpP95jrPNjsnni4vT2mqC3hHdpKcwnjQXprQ0F6Y\"/><figcaption>TVB電視城片場搭建物陷火海。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T07:01:59.534945+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":13,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}